---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects — SlushTec"
  description="VARP and Ashcourt: active development at SlushTec. Permanent residual systems, True Emotion Engine, and original-IP dark fantasy."
>
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <p class="text-warm-earth text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Active Development</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-golden-glow mb-4">Projects</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">
      Systems that keep score. Original IP only. Local-first where it matters. No soft resets.
    </p>

    <article id="varp" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="aspect-video bg-surface rounded-lg border border-surface flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-gray-600 text-sm">VARP visual — pending</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-white">VARP</h2>
          <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-warm-earth/20 text-warm-earth border border-warm-earth/40">Active</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-golden-glow text-sm mb-4">Virtual Action Role Play · Playable vertical slice (CP-3.1)</p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          A modular, local-first Virtual LARP engine. You act freely inside reactive mini-universes whose inhabitants keep permanent score. 
          Features the True Emotion Engine (bias + residue, not transcripts), soul-bound residual systems, bidirectional relationships that can rise or collapse, and original World Packs.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-1 mb-4">
          <li>• Permanent consequence ledger + Echo system</li>
          <li>• Living Relationship Radar (multi-vector, asymmetric decay)</li>
          <li>• True-Name / Soul-Contract rituals</li>
          <li>• World Clock + absence residual</li>
          <li>• Annex ⇄ Street loop currently playable</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Adult 18+. Original IP only. Local-first (Ollama / ComfyUI optional cloud).</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article id="ashcourt" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="aspect-video bg-surface rounded-lg border border-surface flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Ashcourt visual — pending</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-white">Ashcourt — Hell Rises</h2>
          <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface text-gray-300 border border-surface">Parallel</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-golden-glow text-sm mb-4">Original-IP dark fantasy aRPG · Flagship World Pack</p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          You claw up from nothing in a living hell of rings, contracts, and reputation. 
          Intent-based combat, lasting wounds, true-name contracts, and living infrastructure. 
          The proving ground for True Emotion Engine V2 and the first commercial World Pack for VARP.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-1 mb-4">
          <li>• Intent combat — declare approach; scars persist</li>
          <li>• Reputation & true-name contracts (word is ledgered)</li>
          <li>• Living infrastructure (resort, rings, diplomacy)</li>
          <li>• Hybrid dialogue (scripted critical + live LLM core cast)</li>
          <li>• Soft death transforms rather than reloads</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Godot 4.7 vertical slice in progress. Original IP only.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
